event: response.output_text.done
data: {"sequence_number":216,"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_5502d07b-54b5-916d-bff8-d60aebb0f5a9","output_index":5,"text":"**The official website of the Lisbon Oceanarium (Oceanário de Lisboa) is https://oceanario.pt/en/ (English) or https://oceanario.pt/ (Portuguese).**[[1]](https://oceanario.pt/en/)\n\n**Opening hours (as listed on the official site):**  \n- **Daily**: 10:00 AM – 8:00 PM (last entry at 7:00 PM).  \n- **24 and 31 December**: 10:00 AM – 7:00 PM (last entry at 6:00 PM).  \n- **25 December and 1 January**: 11:00 AM – 8:00 PM (last entry at 7:00 PM).[[1]](https://oceanario.pt/en/)\n\nThese hours are confirmed across multiple pages on the official site, including the homepage, “Plan your visit,” “Contact us,” and FAQs. Hours can occasionally change, so check the official site directly before visiting for the most up-to-date information.","logprobs":[]}

